{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5e1fe7f187dd829aae0d62ee439de7cc2bb5344b36ae53be7d4deac7e540272",
      "text": "连结的心意，传递的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c668dc1d456dd30cfc21873b13cdf58648ca599af9fdc5a76008288e9c99fd1f",
      "text": "为了让年轻群体对日本传统工艺产生兴趣，\n彩接到了举办小型演出的邀约。\n为了让展览会更加热闹，三人思索着是否有自己力所能及之事，\n并主动提出了方案。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5e1fe7f187dd829aae0d62ee439de7cc2bb5344b36ae53be7d4deac7e540272",
      "text": "连结的心意，传递的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69d15ba9b45b9926d6a31f4ac1be0b842457b21d728e81250144e74fad886a1a",
      "text": "传统工艺展览会·会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02f2a89ec6891f07f27d402d42e470ef992a92a0f255370c67e49ed2135a18ab",
      "text": "这只抹茶碗的色泽真是绝美呢。器型也很易于点茶，\n感觉能够推荐给许多不同的人使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c3b4e015a8250c27f87fee760220c34a92c5d84663e122459fe5981e3bdc453",
      "text": "哎呀，这匹布料真不错呢。\n图样设计相当抓人眼球。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc673422f714a73d786735df9364a03379aceaf586db0ac9c15a01267f07a8a",
      "text": "咱还琢磨有什么熟悉的老物件呢，果然还是高座折扇\n喵。这可真是好东西喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e80c9e2dbe0da475019e5f69295f42df0eae1e3f1f584831a0a6f3027fb37a8c",
      "text": "各位果然最先留意的，\n还是自己熟悉的传统工艺品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:123073765403e28ad35225468c57566cf2d46835cba95d17a137e5eeded8e7ce",
      "text": "抱歉，一时有些忘情了……不过，其他传统工艺品\n也同样非常出色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35b07db5ed7906895a875d743151ffce1416ff68fee30a73c5d033d85b86f9b8",
      "text": "为了能让更多的年轻人们都来欣赏这些展品，\n我们一定会好好做好宣传的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8038cca0186135a33ed7a19bde06a7dd64b24b6aa08ccbea198d6a7d4534164",
      "text": "就拜托各位了。正因为是长期沉浸于传统艺术的各位，\n才一定有只有你们才能传达的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17d244bde97484e33fe8ae5168181ed9f398e789ac13ef0092f3cf72a1657e3",
      "text": "对方就是看中这一点才发来委托的不是吗？\n我们会拿出超出他们预期的成果给他们看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2483c6c1664b0ff0f1beb3a0b03f39a4b52138339f06ebf9a3472a202fb341e",
      "text": "借助在下们的力量，不仅是演出，\n连同这展览会也要轰轰烈烈地办得热热闹闹喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a155c11870848d3111e1da8d371901a82dcc91e1ec480f194dea63b8ef8bce0",
      "text": "嗯，我很期待！那么在商讨会开始之前\n还有一些时间，我们再多看看展品吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
